    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Karl/Karl 92",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "1.3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Karl/Karl 92",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "2.1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "KANSAS STATE UNIVERSITY",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Environmental Physics Group, Department of Agronomy, Kansas State University,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Throckmorton Hall, Manhattan, KS  66506-5501, USA.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Update on heavy metals in soil at the Manhattan, KS, Biosolids Farm growing winter wheat.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "M. Stanley Liphadzi and M.B. Kirkham.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Last year, we reported concentrations of heavy metals in soil at the Manhattan, KS, Biosolids Farm, which grows winter",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "wheat on the sludge-injected soil.  However, the samples that we reported as ‘controls’ were not labelled correctly.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "These samples came from a new part of the farm that had received sludge during the summer of 2000.  This area is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "labelled ‘Area XIV’ on the map of the sludge farm.  The sludge came from a lagoon that had held the aerobically",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "digested sludge (2 % solids or less) since 1978.  The lagoon was 0.33 ha in area and 5.18 m in depth.  All of this liquid",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "was applied during the early summer of 2000 at a rate of 14.9 metric tons/ha to a field, which then grew soybeans that",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "summer.  The soil was sampled on 30 November, 2000, by personnel at the Manhattan, KS, Wastewater Treatment Plant.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "The soil that had received sludge yearly for 25 years and that grew winter wheat, in the old area of the farm, was",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "sampled by the personnel on 13 March, 2001.  This old area is labelled ‘Area IV’ on the map of the sludge farm, which",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "was established in 1976.  In the early years of the sludge farm (1976–92), 32 t/ha dry sludge were applied yearly.  On 25",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "November, 1992, the EPA published regulations limiting land disposal of sludge (known as the 40 Code of Federal",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Regulations Part 503) and rates of sludge application now must be based on agronomically acceptable practices, which",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "depend on the type of crop grown and its nitrogen requirements.  Because we had no control samples, on 8 June, 2002,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "we sampled soil adjacent to Area IV.   This area was fenced-off and holds the shed that houses the sludge injector when it",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "is not in use.  We now report the concentration of metals in the three different areas (Table 1).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "In general, our conclusions from last year hold.  That is, the results show that, after 25 years of application of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "biosolids to the farm, concentrations of heavy metals have not increased in the soil, except for Cu, Pb, and Zn.  Lead is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "the only toxic heavy metal, and the reason for its elevated level is not known.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
